# Meridian Kernel .gitignore
#
# Instance checkouts, if someone places one inside this working tree. The
# canonical documents of Meridian's own development (owner intent, program
# plans, architecture decisions, RFCs) live tracked under governance/, not
# under .agent/ or any Instance checkout — ignoring these paths never hides
# canonical Kernel content.
/instance/
/instances/
/.agent/
/meridian-instance-*/
/*-instance/

# Secrets — never, in any form.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*.json
secrets*.yaml
secrets*.yml

# Transient.
tmp/
_to_delete/
*.tmp
evidence/raw/
screenshots/
*.har

# Tooling. Local editor and viewer state: the Kernel is a folder of Markdown and
# can be opened by any tool that reads one as a graph. Whatever config such a
# tool leaves behind is that operator's, not the Kernel's.
node_modules/
/target/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
.obsidian/
*.log
